{"id": "t061-054", "text": "Gareth - mentioned he's bored @ work, looking around quietly. good w/ Excel, ex-Army. maybe pass on Hana's company's opening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored @ work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking around", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "good w/ Excel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "ex-Army", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pass on Hana's company's opening", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t061-055", "text": "long call w/ Isla tonight. job hunt not going well - 3 rejections this month, last one after final round @ Ocado. she's thinking of retraining, maybe teaching. PGCE applications close 31 Jan 2027. her mum keeps saying move back to Inverness, Isla v much does not want to. Jonah's being supportive. she's skint till payday 28th. don't forget to send her that TES link + check in after she hears from Sainsbury's", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job hunt", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this month"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of retraining, maybe teaching", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PGCE applications", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 Jan 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till payday 28th"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that TES link", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hears from Sainsbury's", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t061-056", "text": "viewing #3 today - Clapham 1-bed, nice but no washing machine + 6th floor no lift. #4 Weds 12/11 Brixton. deposit needs to be ready by 1 December 2026. ask landlord re early end of current tenancy (ends 14 Jan). sort references - ask Krisztina to be referee?", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing #3", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "#4", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds 12/11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "deposit needs to be ready", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 1 December 2026", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask landlord re early end of current tenancy", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ends", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 Jan", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort references", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Krisztina to be referee", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t061-057", "text": "caught Nasser + his wife Sana @ the station. they've been house hunting in Manchester for months, finally offer accepted on a 3-bed in Didsbury. exchanging 21st of November, moving 9 Dec if all goes ok. their son Ayo starts at the local nursery in Jan. Nasser's commute's going to be brutal for a bit - he's keeping the London job til March 2027 then going remote. remind me to send a moving card + ask Nasser how exchange went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer accepted on a 3-bed in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exchanging", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "21st of November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 Dec", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "local nursery", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Jan", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "London job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "til March 2027", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going remote", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a moving card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Nasser how exchange went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t061-058", "text": "Ana and Bruno split up :( wedding (was 3 May 2027) is off. she's staying w/ her parents in Reading for now, flat's on the market. said she's ok but not sleeping. also job interview @ Penguin next Thurs she's been prepping for weeks - good distraction she says. text her Wed nt good luck + check in this wknd. need to take back the bridesmaid dress order too, Ana asked me to sort it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 May 2027"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Reading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview @ Penguin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thurs", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her Wed nt good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wed nt", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "this wknd", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take back the bridesmaid dress order", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t061-059", "text": "Hiroshi - interview prep. panel 3 ppl, 45 min, competency + technical. Mon 16 Nov 2:30. he's v anxious, didn't sleep before last one. asked me to do a mock Sat am. bought him the STAR method book. also his partner Fang just started @ the same firm, diff team, so slightly awkward if he gets it. text him after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "45 min", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon 16 Nov 2:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before last one"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "do a mock", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat am", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started @ the same firm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t061-060", "text": "Jasmine (Jas) - viewing went badly, flat was tiny. still looking in Glasgow before the move", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jas", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
